## 1. Project overview

Retail stores need to know how much they will sell in the coming days to plan staffing and stock. This project predicts the **daily sales of each Rossmann store, 7 days ahead**, using the store's past sales, the calendar, and information that is known in advance, such as promotions and holidays.

The project covers the full workflow of a small machine learning project:

- Data loading and cleaning
- Exploratory data analysis (EDA) and visualisation
- Feature engineering for time series (lag and rolling features)
- Baseline models, Linear Regression and LightGBM
- Hyperparameter tuning and time-series cross-validation
- An interactive Streamlit dashboard

