## 15. Glossary

| Term | Meaning |
|---|---|
| **Lag feature** | A past value of the target, for example sales 14 days ago |
| **Rolling mean** | The average over a moving window of recent days |
| **Data leakage** | Using information in training that would not be available when making real predictions |
| **Time-based split** | Training on the past and validating on the future, never mixing them |
| **Cross-validation** | Repeating the train/validate procedure on several time periods to check the result is stable |
| **LightGBM** | A fast gradient-boosted decision tree library |
| **Log target** | Training on `log(1 + sales)` to reduce the influence of very large values |
| **MAE / RMSE / MAPE** | Error metrics, defined in section 8 |
| **Baseline** | A simple model that any real model must beat |
